Adds two optional request fields to POST /sam/sam-predict of sd-webui-segment-anything.

output_mode: "all" (default, unchanged upstream response), "masks" (the 3 masks only) or
"mask_top1" (only the mask at mask_index, as {"masks": [mask]}; {} when nothing is segmented).
mask_index: 0-2 (default 0).

The ImageBlur and SegmentOCR clients send output_mode="mask_top1", mask_index=0. With upstream
code the fields are ignored and the server returns all 9 images; the clients would still use
masks[0], but the responses would be much larger than in the measured runs.
Base: continue-revolution/sd-webui-segment-anything @ 982138cfb505de61a3cbb257b2fa9d461d9b5493

